{"id":"sw-3a604e","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-d3c968ca-e20e-406c-9caf-095b7816abc3","text":"**Review round 1** — User: water/fluids and weather are integral; account for them early.\n\nResolution applied (spec updated first, then doc): **representation early, simulation late.**\n\n- New decisions **D9** (still water = ordinary voxel material + active-sim brick promotion for flow) and **D10** (fog/god rays = participating media accumulated on the existing primary march); new §10 *Water \u0026 atmosphere*; milestone table extended with M8 (`sw-0656de` Water) and M9 (`sw-7dd08f` Atmosphere \u0026 Weather); transmission-cost risk added; heat sims remain the only deferred sim.\n- Representation reserved in M1, not deferred: amended `sw-3afd48` (aux per-brick channels), `sw-30aa3c` (traversal continuation + accumulation hooks), `sw-00ae86` (water table in generator v0).\n- 9 new stories filed under the two epics; both epics depend on Lighting (`sw-c13774`); rain depends on water representation; flow sim depends on CSG edits."},"created_at":"2026-08-05T19:45:44.932414Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
