{"id":"sw-d7b616","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Render scale knob: configurable resolution with bilinear upscale","description":"Add a render scale slider (0.25–1.0) to the debug panel. The raymarcher renders at `floor(window_size × scale)` and the blit pass upscales to the window with bilinear filtering.\n\nOn Retina/HiDPI displays, the default physical pixel count is 4× the logical size (e.g. 2560×1440 for a 1280×720 window). Rendering at scale 0.5 recovers that 4× cost immediately.\n\n**Scope:**\n- Render scale slider in the egui debug panel (default 0.5 on HiDPI, 1.0 otherwise)\n- Raymarcher output texture sized to `window × scale`\n- Blit sampler changed from Nearest to Linear\n- Debug panel shows both render resolution and window resolution\n- Frame time graph should show the speedup immediately","status":"PLANNED","parent_id":"sw-aa609f","estimate":1,"sort_order":"aG","dependencies":[{"source_id":"sw-d7b616","target_id":"sw-30aa3c","kind":"depends_on"}],"labels":["feature","perf"]},"created_at":"2026-08-05T23:41:51.022322Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"sw-d7b616","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING","assignee":"Claude Code \u003cagent@macbook.local\u003e"},"created_at":"2026-08-05T23:41:57.847361Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"sw-d7b616","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-3a9b0ab8-e514-4ee0-92a4-bf69cab5e087","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `render_scale` slider (0.25–1.0) to the debug panel. Raymarcher output texture is sized to `window × scale`, blit sampler switched from Nearest to Linear for smooth upscale. Default 0.5 on HiDPI (Retina), 1.0 otherwise.\n\n**Modified files:**\n- `crates/engine/src/raymarcher.rs` — blit sampler `Nearest` → `Linear`\n- `crates/viewer/src/main.rs` — `render_scale` in `RunState`, slider in debug panel, scale applied to raymarcher dimensions on init/resize/slider change, debug panel shows both window and render resolution\n\n## Status\n\nGPU Compute dropped from ~10 ms to ~4 ms at 0.5 scale on Retina (2560×1440 → 1280×720). Tests pass, clippy clean."},"created_at":"2026-08-05T23:44:49.018545Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
