{"id":"sw-b975c9","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-e9b1b387-4b5e-422a-a4cf-215ab3cf407d","text":"## Summary\n\nBVH over instance AABBs replaces linear scan for both primary and shadow rays.\n\n**New:** `crates/engine/src/bvh.rs` — flat-array BVH with midpoint split, 4 unit tests.\n**Modified:** `scene.rs` (builds BVH during upload, reorders instances to BVH leaf order), `raymarcher.rs` (binding 7 for BVH nodes), `raymarch.wgsl` (stack-based BVH traversal for primary + shadow rays), `model_gen.rs` (added pebble generator), viewer (389 instances: trees + rocks + pebbles).\n\n## Status\n\n29 tests pass, clippy clean. 389 objects at 13K+ FPS on M1 Max."},"created_at":"2026-08-06T06:40:04.566378Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
