{"id":"sw-a708d5","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-11e453e5-8912-4395-8fb4-ce9fd268177c","text":"\n## Summary\n\n`svo.rs` — Sparse Voxel Octree data structure with flat-array GPU buffer.\n\n- `SvoNode`: 16 bytes (children index, brick handle, packed RGBA color, flags with child mask)\n- `Svo`: node pool with contiguous 8-child block allocation, free-list, GPU storage buffer\n- `insert_brick()`: subdivides from root to target depth, creates intermediate nodes\n- `update_colors()`: bottom-up recursive averaging of leaf colors to interior nodes\n- 3 unit tests: single insert, two-brick color averaging, node count growth\n\n## Status\n\n34 tests pass, clippy clean, fmt clean. Ready for story 2 (SVO raymarcher).\n"},"created_at":"2026-08-06T13:16:47.743103Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.222 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
