{"id":"sw-ac1601","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-8c978485-ce69-46bd-9651-3b1aa5f9f089","text":"**Summary:** Added task dependencies via atomic prerequisite counting to `jobs.rs`. New types: `TaskInner` (completion callbacks), `Dependency` (type-erased dep handle), `join()`. `Scheduler` trait gains `spawn_after()`. `RayonScheduler.pool` changed to `Arc\u003crayon::ThreadPool\u003e` so callbacks can capture pool references.\n\n**Rationale:** UE5-style decentralized dependency resolution. `AtomicU32::fetch_sub` on the hot path, `Mutex` only for callback registration/dispatch (not contended in practice).\n\n**Decisions made:**\n- Task retraction deferred to sw-2ca320 (custom scheduler) — rayon doesn't expose its queues.\n- Main-thread result channel dropped — StreamStage already uses `TaskHandle` polling.\n- `on_complete` checks `completed` flag under lock to handle the race between registration and completion.\n\n**Status:** 95 tests passing (10 new), clippy clean, ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-08-08T12:53:18.989175Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.225 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
